    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><em>武器（現代子彈），非普通</em> <br />這隻水蛭被風乾已久，其中蘊含着一股活化的魔力。如果你用這種彈藥發動的遠程武器攻擊擊中了一個生物，水蛭將復活並立刻將它的牙齒嵌在目標身上，之後，每個目標的回合開始時水蛭將對其造成[[/damage 1d4 type=piercing]]傷害。如果這隻水蛭合計造成了10點或更多傷害、或它的目標死亡，它將自動掉落下來。生物（包括目標自己）也可以用自己的動作來拔下水蛭。<br />一旦水蛭離開它的目標，它就會再度死亡並不再具有魔法。</p><p>This leech has been dried and imbued with a mote of animating magic. If you hit a creature with a ranged attack roll using this ammunition, the leech springs to life and sinks its teeth into the target, dealing [[/damage 1d4 type=piercing]] damage at the start of each of the target's turns. If the leech deals at least 10 damage or the target dies, the leech falls off. A creature, including the target, can use its action to detach the leech. Once a leech is no longer attached to its target, the leech dies and is no longer magical.</p></div>",
